Package: artcatr
Title: Sample Size and Power for an Ordered Categorical Outcome
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("André", "Moser", "andre.moser@unibe.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7178-6539")
Description: Sample size and power calculations for a two-group randomized
    trial with an ordered categorical outcome analysed by the
    proportional-odds model. Implements the 'ologit' method of White,
    Marley-Zagar, Morris, Parmar, Royston & Babiker (2023)
    <doi:10.1177/1536867X231161934> in R.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
